OL,3,GNEWSANesting seagulls delay reopening
OL,4,Aof library
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe reopening of a library has been
OL,7,Fdelayed after nesting seagulls delayed
OL,8,Fbuilding work.
OL,10,FPoole Library and Customer Service Hub
OL,11,Fin Poole's Dolphin Centre in Dorset has
OL,12,Fbeen closed from Monday to Friday since
OL,13,F26 August while work continues to
OL,14,Fremove Raac concrete from the building.
OL,16,FBut, following the discovery of nesting
OL,17,Fgulls, workers have been unable to
OL,18,Faccess parts the roof and the
OL,19,Fconstruction program has been delayed.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
